# The archers' link skill. GMS pairs the critical rate with a Monster
# Collection chance; there is no collection in this game, so the rate is the
# whole of it.
#
# Its ladder is GMS's 3, 4, 6, 7, 9 ... written as the point and a half a
# level it really is, which lands on GMS's own value at every odd rung and
# half a point above it at the even ones.
name: "Adventurer's Curiosity"
description: "Your curiosity about the world sharpens your eye for a weak spot."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_LINK skill_order: 3 }
link_line: JOB_ARCHER
max_level: 9
base { crit_rate: 0.03 }
per_level { crit_rate: 0.015 }
